v class=\"message\">Its worth asking what Humanity or integrity is it to Traffic human beings?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd say 8. &quot;Creating a ghoul. Depriving another of consent with a discipline.&quot;<br /> <br /> Its also generally a topic in my favorite vampire (not necessarily cofd) storylines, like Daybreakers and Castlevania. Its also a natural conclusion of wanting to 100% keep vampires a secret, and lots of fresh blood.<br /> <br /> For integrity, well, it doesn't have a hierarchy of sins outside of hunter, where its probably a middling breaking point, or low if you're selling them to monsters. But, its probably the worst thing your character has done, and thus a breaking point, perhaps at -5. After that, though, you won't take breaking points for the same thing, unless the new one is somehow the new worst thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11876,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","user":"Deinos","date":". 03-12-2020, 10:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-13T02:15:48-07:00","id":1374521,"title":"","content":"So I can make a humanity 4 or 5 Vamp Who is involved in Sex Trafficking?!<br /> <br /> YAY!!!<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-13T12:41:20-07:00","id":1374617,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1373844-slavery-and-all-its-permutations-in-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1374521#post1374521\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I can make a humanity 4 or 5 Vamp Who is involved in Sex Trafficking?!</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a pretty human activity.<br /> <br /> With a big 'it depends' regarding individual vampires, as well as individual domains and covenant representatives. There's whole bloodlines dedicated to both freeing people from slavery and enslaving people. You can manage most abhorrent activities if you're careful about your humanity, but if you throw abandon to the wind then you're more likely to drop.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"ht